        <mxCell id="0aO-CmuE0NpzSz74Vj0y-74" value="&lt;h1&gt;Country Setup - Austria&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Austria, &lt;i&gt;Validated Metering and Consumption Data&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;is stored and made available by the &lt;i&gt;Distribution System Operators (DSO)&lt;/i&gt;. In order to get access to that data, please go to &lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://ebutilities.at/utilities/marktpartner/registration/index.php&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;and create and account. Then, after your account as been created and you have signed and sent your EDA contract, please got to&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;http://jira.ponton.de/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;servicedesk/customer/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and open a support account. Then - depending on the Service Level (&lt;i&gt;Secure Email Gateway&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;Full AS4 Stack&lt;/i&gt;), - commence with following the instructions to get your public/private key pair.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#666666;" parent="0aO-CmuE0NpzSz74Vj0y-66" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="200" width="810" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
