        <mxCell id="s63_j0Tm_o9iD8T7rFJs-159" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-size: 30px&quot;&gt;Region Setup - Austria&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 6px&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Please go to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://ebutilities.at/utilities/marktpartner/registration/index.php&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and create and account. Then&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;open a support account. Then - depending on the Service Level (&lt;i&gt;Secure Email Gateway&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;Full AS4 Stack&lt;/i&gt;), - commence with following the instructions to get your public/private key pair.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#666666;" parent="0aO-CmuE0NpzSz74Vj0y-66" vertex="1">
