        <mxCell id="0aO-CmuE0NpzSz74Vj0y-28" value="&lt;h1&gt;Country Setup - Spain&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Spain, &lt;i&gt;Validated Metering and Consumption Data&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;is stored and made available by the &lt;i&gt;Distribution System Operators (DSO)&lt;/i&gt;. In order to get access to that data, please go to &lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://datadis.es&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt; and create and account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; If you are not a domestic legal entity, you will need a Spanish &lt;i&gt;VAT for foreigners &lt;/i&gt;for the registration process. To get a &lt;i&gt;VAT for foreigners&lt;/i&gt;, you need to ....&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a result of your registration, you will receive a username and a password that XXXX needs to communicate with Datadis. Please provide this information here:&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#666666;" parent="0aO-CmuE0NpzSz74Vj0y-20" vertex="1">
