        <mxCell id="s63_j0Tm_o9iD8T7rFJs-94" value="&lt;h1&gt;Region Setup - Spain&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 1px&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;In order to get access to that data, please go to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;https://datadis.es&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt; and create and account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&lt;/b&gt; If you are not a domestic legal entity, you will need a Spanish &lt;i&gt;VAT for foreigners &lt;/i&gt;for the registration process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px&quot;&gt;As a result of your registration, you will receive a username and a password that the &lt;i&gt;EDDIE Framework&lt;/i&gt; needs to communicate with Datadis. Please provide this information here:&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#666666;" parent="s63_j0Tm_o9iD8T7rFJs-40" vertex="1">
